e=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           1952年，\n          </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n</span>\n<span style='background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           由\n          </span>\n<span style='background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           Hernandez家族\n          </span>\n<span style='background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           所拥有，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           位于慧兰省的\n          </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n           Cisne镇，11公顷的面积里有6公顷是自然保育区，有一些稀有的哺乳动物，鸟类栖息，5公顷种植咖啡；最初种植卡杜拉，也凭借一\n          </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n           支\n           <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            传统水洗处理的卡杜拉赢得了2005年哥伦比亚北部区域CoE竞赛的第一名；\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           现在第三代Oscar Hernandez负责打理，从小它就是8个兄弟姐妹里对咖啡最感兴趣的那一个，不上学的时候他总喜欢在咖啡田里，处理厂上跑，边玩边学着各种咖啡知识；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SVRVOK3WTnORFVdeWqK38NKnSLBHauR5FB0uxArlOE0hB977aeE1mnTia58g8S2UnzbLyJjlshtTQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2005年的成名，让Hernandez家庭因为咖啡在当时当地名利双收，日本的丸山咖啡成为了Nogales的最大客户，随后几年随着丸山的采购也让Nogales的经济收益逐年提高，悲伤的是，成名让整个家庭成为了当地的游击队的目标，2013年，父亲\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n           Ricaurte Hernández被游击队绑架，不甘于妥协也不想让刚刚走上幸福路的家庭缴纳大笔赎金而一夜回到解放前，父亲选择了自杀式的反抗，还在参军中的Oscar一夜之间做了人生中的重要决定，回家接起父亲的担子，那年Oscar 24岁。\n          </span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SVRVOK3WTnORFVdeWqK38NeKMia4cvjnqwbqS8RoLFDX074JvIRm0pq9cwAVibWNPdwFMqcv19AqWg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          对质量的追求与不妥协，对未知事务的好奇和探索，Oscar将Nogales做的越来越好，他的目标就是要让父亲为他自豪，不满足于评分表上的高分，而是要让Nogales成为哥伦比亚的领军，他个人也想能进入哥伦比亚生产者协会FNC的理事，能成为对哥伦比亚咖啡有举足轻重影响力的人。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SVRVOK3WTnORFVdeWqK38NFRBdLCS8hdbwc9uGJMq3Dkxw8ouWTfWaNKZ5QeUWt3IY1Rb0CzHfEA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          文中图片、资料部分来自/翻译自 https://vicafe.ch/en/oscar-hernandez-a-risk-taker/\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
